                "text": "Indian Medicines and Pharmaceuticals Corporation Limited"
              },
              {
                "type": "item",
                "num": "v",
                "text": "Rashtriya Ayurveda Vidyapeeth."
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "6",
                "text": "Education, Training and Research in all aspects of Indian Systems of Medicine including higher training abroad."
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "7",
                "text": "Matters of cadre formation and control including formation and amendment of recruitment rules, recruitment, promotion and all other service matters relating to Indian Systems of Medicine and Homoeopathy doctors of Central Government Health Scheme including doctors in Indian Systems of Medicine and Homoeopathy central hospitals requiring action at Government level."
              },
              {
                "type": "note",
                "text": "Note.- Day-to-day administration and management will continue to be with the Director, Central Government Health Scheme."
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "8",
                "text": "Liaison with foreign countries and international bodies as regards matters relating to Indian Systems of Medicine and Homoeopathy."
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "9",
                "text": "Matters relating to scientific societies/associations and charitable and religious endowments relating to Indian Systems of Medicine and Homoeopathy."
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "10",
                "text": "Matters relating to quality and standards for drugs in Indian Systems of Medicine and Homoeopathy to the extent such matters require action at the level of Government."
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "11",
                "text": "Consultation and coordination with State Governments, Non-Government Organisations and institutions for review of work and programmes in Indian Systems of Medicine and Homoeopathy."
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "12",
                "text": "Statistics relating to various aspects of Indian Systems of Medicine and Homoeopathy."
              },
              {
                "type": "entry",
                "num": "13",
